  "boundaries": [
    "This is a test-only extension of the committed 33-stage physical client-operation implementation, not another production source change. The exact five checker/fixture edits are audited, and all three freshly packed public package archives match the committed implementation byte-for-byte.",
    "Each source/installed probe repeats the 30 native mixed cases and 21 two-transport fault categories, then adds six writable-generation-author cohorts: original/atomic native wire formats crossed with local, relay and retained client modes. These supplemental author cohorts use the v1 grammar; the existing mixed matrix still covers all ten native physical profiles.",
